From 53dcff9aa9db8b003e414377cbc8b47d07683961 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jeebuscrossaint <thediamond270@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:18:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 27/29] config: real configuration pass

- MODKEY -> Super (was Alt); the 13 MODKEY|LOGO binds moved to Super+Alt so
  they would not collapse onto plain MODKEY
- layouts moved to Super+Ctrl+<key>; 12 layout binds had taken most of the
  alphabet and blocked the sway app binds
- colors from the framer coat scheme, mirroring the sway client.* mapping
  (base00/03/05/08 only, focus by brightness not hue)
- font MartianMono Nerd Font Mono:size=10
- menucmd tofi-drun; autostart ported from the sway exec lines
- portal path corrected to /usr/lib (the sway config's /usr/libexec never ran)
- app + media keybinds ported from sway; added SHCMD macro
---
 config.def.h | 127 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 90 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

